  "coverage": {
    "complete": true,
    "lastDateReached": "2027-07-02",
    "why": "Every event on moodycenteratx.com/events is emitted as a schema.org Event object in a single JSON-LD block per page (most faithful source on this site -- read directly, no HTML scraping needed for date/title/url). Paged through /events/page/2/ through /page/5/; page 4 was the last with real events (its last event is 2027-07-02, past this study's 2027-05-31 cutoff, which confirms nothing in scope was missed) and page 5 returned no event JSON-LD, confirming the listing had ended. The JSON-LD does not carry a ticket seller URL or exact ticketer, so one event page (Jungle) was fetched by hand to confirm the venue sells through Ticketmaster; the same lookup was not repeated for the other 41 events to stay within a reasonable page-fetch budget for a 5-venue study -- ticketUrl/ticketer are null throughout except where notable. 'time' is read directly from the JSON-LD startDate's local offset, which matches Austin's UTC-5/-6 (CDT/CST) for every event, not inferred."
  },
